  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Oxylabs is an enterprise proxy and web-data platform (residential, datacenter, mobile, ISP, Web Unblocker, Web Scraper API). Residential Starter publishes at 5GB for $30/mo ($6/GB); Basic 20GB $100; Advanced 125GB $500; Corporate 1TB $2,500. Web Scraper API starts from $49/mo. Datacenter proxies offer a free trial. ISO/IEC 27001:2022 certified products. Same web-data-collection cluster as Bright Data — not ITSM, observability, or hosting panels.",
    "bestFor": [
      "Data teams that need enterprise residential/datacenter proxies with published self-serve floors",
